prompt":{"digest":"29252a229ac6f0b7b517d98220feb332a39c9b9ab9428bcbe07f0f62daf6cfa2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":184},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"f48cf11a0b2fdc33c38775e20266e94eee5cb5495f6abbec4f50084bb43eafd0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":13260},"state":{"digest":"5d5037568a2c0aaa56005d43bb3ef96bb08023ae10cd55ab909f28cd60ed6335","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-19T20:50:49.188796+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.1","local_name":"bob-cli-no.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-no","agent_clan_generation":"20261119144819","bead_id":"bob-cli-no.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-no[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]bob bank import -D: import the week's downloads, then delete them[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bank import -D ~/Downloads/*.qfx`, typed into Bob Command Mode or [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a shell, previews the import and the planned deletions. Ctrl+Enter [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]imports the batch, then permanently deletes exactly the source [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]files bob parsed. It deletes them only if the whole batch was [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]recorded and each file is unchanged since bob read it. A refused or[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]failed import keeps every file, and the output says so.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bank_import_delete.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/bank_import_delete.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-no[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-no/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob expands ~ and glob patterns in bank import FILE operands[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]expand[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]expand: add a shared native::host_paths operand expander (tilde, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]literal-first glob, dedupe, no-match refusal) and adopt it in bob bank [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]import. Also light up the \"bank\" Command Mode invalidation tag, filter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion to exports, add a macOS privacy hint for unreadable files, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and document file patterns.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The -D/--delete flag, its delete gate, output, JSON, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]delete[dim] · [dim][/dim]after expand[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]delete: add -D/--delete with an up-front check of each file, a gate that[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deletes only after the batch succeeds and only files whose bytes still [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]match their digest, per-file outcomes, colored human output, an additive[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON `delete` object, exit codes, and the docs/bank.md and Monday guide [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bank card weekly-import button opens the Command Mode preview[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after delete[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card: in bob-plugins, turn the bank queue card's static \"Weekly import\" [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]footer text into a one-click chip. The chip opens the Command Mode [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview of `bank import -D ~/Downloads/*.qfx` and shows a fallback [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notice only when Command Mode is unavailable.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-no","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-no.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-776ba0fead79002840e48997e292826d","started_at":"2026-11-19T19:48:53.186243+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"a75c8367fdf77dc06e2a6766caef9d44b441b5aa13ef652659f8d95d3adcfef6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.land--mon-0/chat.md","size_bytes":8519},"commits":{"digest":"713441d9947ebc5f05fae24dbb6d3c659946831c92ecd51c9805be239d522dc2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.land--mon-0/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"2a8392c705db2f22aa5838b707c6f050b49306a59adce952bccfd7f606755c5b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.land--mon-0/meta.json","size_bytes":688},"state":{"digest":"dd5611c7e4923cd0536424a6a5dbacc0a20e3309ce0d5db3a8841a13c3101429","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.land--mon-0/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-19T23:08:36.054521+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.land--mon-0","local_name":"bob-cli-no.land--mon-0","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-no","agent_clan_generation":"20261119144819","agent_session":"bob-cli-no.land","agent_session_role":"mon-0","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"mon-0","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-no.land"},"source_run_id":"run-a2d214ff6dfdbde35572cc3317896ae1","started_at":"2026-11-19T23:01:53.000047+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,